# P88 on WSL GtkBackend: hover, hold Command (Super on Linux) without and with moving, drag across the panel, end inside it -- actions/mac/P88-hover-cmd-drag.actions. The panel exposes nothing to AT-SPI; it spans the area above the readouts (pointer line at y 380) in a 440x536 window, so the positions are those of the Mac file, inside it.
# Pass: pointer follows, (cmd) appears while Super is held, last with cmd kept, drags counted, hover reports above 0.
